  <h2>Published T5 engine figures</h2>
  <p>US-market 2021 S60 T5 specifications are commonly listed at 250 hp at 5,500 rpm and 258 lb-ft at 1,500 rpm. Treat these as model-level reference figures, not a substitute for the vehicle's build record.</p>

  <h2>Configuration still to verify</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Front-wheel drive or all-wheel drive.</li>
    <li>Transmission identification and calibration.</li>
    <li>Factory wheel size, tire specification, and spare-tire equipment.</li>
    <li>Installed packages and individual option codes.</li>
    <li>Factory paint code associated with the Denim Blue finish.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Inscription trim and T5 badging do not by themselves establish every installed option. Use the VIN-specific Volvo build information and the labels on the vehicle before ordering parts or applying service specifications.</p>

